From 48584d4ce89113f9730666ff3135ed59abdf8192 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2?= <Njcki@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:46:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(contracts): condivisione thread, limite messaggi da 500 a
 5000 / thread sharing: raise message limit from 500 to 5000
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

IT: Condividendo una conversazione lunga (es. 1235 messaggi) il dialog dava
"Input validation failed": lo schema di `threadShares/create` limitava
`messageIds` a 500, quindi selezionare più di 500 messaggi falliva la
validazione oRPC. Il limite di body RPC (16 MB) è ampiamente sufficiente per
l'array degli id, quindi il vincolo era solo quello dello schema. Alzato il
limite da 500 a 5000: copre conversazioni molto lunghe e resta un cap sensato
contro richieste anomale. Solo contracts (validazione condivisa da api e web).

EN: Sharing a long conversation (e.g. 1235 messages) made the dialog show
"Input validation failed": the `threadShares/create` schema capped
`messageIds` at 500, so selecting more than 500 messages failed oRPC
validation. The RPC body limit (16 MB) is far above the id array's size, so
the only constraint was the schema. Raised the limit from 500 to 5000: it
covers very long conversations and stays a sensible cap against abnormal
requests. Contracts only (validation shared by api and web).
---
 packages/contracts/src/rpc.ts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/packages/contracts/src/rpc.ts b/packages/contracts/src/rpc.ts
index 842bc470..c311d76c 100644
--- a/packages/contracts/src/rpc.ts
+++ b/packages/contracts/src/rpc.ts
@@ -423,7 +423,7 @@ export const appContract = {
       .input(
         z.object({
           botId: Id,
-          messageIds: z.array(Id).min(1).max(500),
+          messageIds: z.array(Id).min(1).max(5000),
           title: z.string().trim().min(1).max(200).optional(),
           expiresInDays: z.number().int().min(1).max(365).optional(),
         }),
-- 
